      "widgets_values": [
        "gemini-3-pro-image-preview",
        "Revise ONLY THE HANGING SIGNBOARD in this room illustration. Everything else stays exactly as it is - the same camera, the same butter-cream room and hexagon floor, the same teal roasting machine, the same coral honeycomb rack, the same mint cart, the same purple parasol vessel, the same pink sack with the nutcracker, the same goods, the same soft modelled shading with no outlines and no texture.\n\nTHE SIGNBOARD FIX: the board currently shows a soft swirled peak of chocolate spread on its right side, and that swirl reads unmistakably like a poop emoji. REMOVE IT COMPLETELY. Do not draw any soft-serve style swirl, no coiled or spiralled peak of chocolate, no twisted dollop, nothing with a curled tip.\n\nIn its place put a clean, appetising chocolate element instead: TWO OR THREE SOLID CHOCOLATE CHUNKS - simple broken squares of dark chocolate with crisp straight edges, stacked at slight angles. Keep them rich chocolate brown.\n\nEverything else on the board is unchanged: the same plaque shape and brown frame, the same whole hazelnuts, the same split hazelnut showing its pale kernel, the same chocolate bar, the same green leaves, the same two small dots on the frame, hanging from the same ropes.\n\nNo text, letters or numbers anywhere. Change nothing else in the room.",
